    },
    {
      "id": "msg_1067_SC07R0401_00001",
      "en_US": "Which prize would you like?"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_1067_SC07R0401_00002",
      "en_US": [
        "So your choice is\n",
        "the {STRVAR_1 8, 0, 0}?"
